  "body": " 1.7.B.3  Programmers can determine the set of possible values produced by a random command by identifying the endpoints and whether they are included. When the following code runs, a random integer from a to b , including a and b , is generated and returned. Each result is equally likely to occur. The possible results of random(a, b) are all integers from a through b .  "
