  "body": " Design Vocabulary   Review the vocabulary in this lesson. Drag the vocabulary term from the left and drop it on its correct definition on the right. Click the \"Check Me\" button to see if you are correct.    Find the words in the lesson above and try again.     iterative development  developing a program through repeated cycles of design, implementation, and testing    incremental development  developing a program by in small steps adding new features or functionality    user research  the process of gathering information about users and their needs    program requirements  the specific needs and constraints that a program must meet to be successful    user stories  short, simple descriptions of a feature from the perspective of the user    storyboard  a visual representation of a sequence of events or scenes    "
