  "title": "",
  "body": " Click on Next to see each step of the loop!   import random min = 99999 # start with a high value for i in range(10): num = random.randint(1, 10) print(num) if num < min: # if num less than min min = num # update min to num print(\"The minimum value is\", min)   "
