  "body": "  Review the vocabulary in this lesson. Drag the vocabulary term from the left and drop it on its correct definition on the right. Click the \"Check Me\" button to see if you are correct.    Find the words in the lesson above and try again.     sequencing  ordering instructions one after another    iteration  repetition of a sequence of instructions    selection  choosing which statements to execute based on certain conditions    algorithm  a step-by-step procedure for solving a problem    accumulator pattern  a loop with a variable that accumulates a sum or total    average  the sum of a set of numbers divided by the size of the set    minimum  the smallest value in a set of numbers    maximum  the largest value in a set of numbers    side effect  a change other than the output to the program's state or variables when the program runs    divide and conquer pattern  an algorithm that divides the problem into smaller parts and solves each part    "
